# =============================================================================
# Git LFS — large binary assets only.
#
# Policy (see also .gitignore):
#   * UPM packages, scoped-registry packages and git-url dependencies are
#     DECLARED ONLY in Packages/manifest.json + Packages/packages-lock.json.
#     Their payload is resolved into Library/PackageCache and is never committed.
#   * Asset source that is physically imported into Assets/ stays in the repo.
#     The large binaries among it (textures, meshes, audio, video, archives)
#     are what LFS is for, below.
#
# ML-Agents output is deliberately NOT tracked by LFS (.pt / .pth / .ckpt /
# .onnx / .nn / .tflite / .h5 / tfevents) — those are training artifacts and
# are excluded outright by .gitignore. Do not add ML patterns to this file.
#
# .codelyignore / .com-unity-codely.json and the Codely bridge package
# (cn.tuanjie.codely.bridge) are tooling, never tracked here.
# =============================================================================

# --- Raster / vector images -------------------------------------------------
*.exr   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.hdr   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.iff   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.tga   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
